    "    \"- POSITIVE\\n\\n\"\n",
    "    \"## ✨ Project Context\\n\"\n",
    "    \"Developed for a final-year capstone project (Bachelor of Information System – Data Analytics) \"\n",
    "    \"focusing on Malaysian COVID-19 social media sentiment analysis using mixed Malay–English text.\\n\\n\"\n",
    "    \"## 📊 Training Details\\n\"\n",
    "    \"- Base model: mBERT\\n\"\n",
    "    \"- Epochs: 4\\n\"\n",
