    "    \"- Batch size: 16\\n\"\n",
    "    \"- Metrics: Accuracy, Precision, Recall, Macro F1\\n\\n\"\n",
    "    \"## 🧪 Strengths\\n\"\n",
    "    \"- Strong performance on code-mixed Malay–English tweets\\n\"\n",
    "    \"- Better contextual understanding than TF-IDF baseline\\n\"\n",
    "    \"- Handles informal Malaysian speech patterns well\\n\\n\"\n",
    "    \"## 🚫 Limitations\\n\"\n",
